    {
        "text": "Flames burst forth above their heads, raining cinders down from the ceiling, igniting the flour and oil atop the stove. In an instant, the kitchen is a sea of fire."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1619_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "*cough* *cough* *cough*!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mo Bufu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1619_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You... go... I'll be fine!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mo Bufu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Cover your mouth and nose! Don't talk!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm not too good with this move yet... let's give it a try.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Scuse me, just duck.",
