    },
    {
        "text": "With a stifled crack of thunder, the remains of the fixture are abruptly flung to one side, and smashed hard against the wall."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1612_1#16$1",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you alright there?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Leizi?! What are YOU doing here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1612_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Maybe I should ask, what are <i>you</i> doing here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1612_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But we can talk about you later...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1612_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Could this be a repeat of the Ding Feng Lou fire last month...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lin Qingyan scans her surroundings. The kitchen chefs are in a frenzied jumble, but her gaze quickly locks onto a masked figure among them."
    },
    {
        "text": "...Who seems to meet her gaze, then turns and vanishes into the crowd."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1612_1#16$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan"
    },
    {
        "text": "Blaze, stay here! Keep Mo Bufu safe!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "posfrom": "0,0",
        "posto": "250,0",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey! Where are you going?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "*cough* *cough*... Jeez, this smoke is killing me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1619_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "*cough* *hack*... On that pillar there, there's a breaker...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mo Bufu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's, uh... a lot of them here... Which one do I pull...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
