    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_clothmovementsp"
    },
    {
        "text": "Flitting like a fowl, Lin Qingyan has her target cornered in just a few spry leaps."
    },
    {
        "text": "Mere meters separate them, but so smoky is the air that she can't quite make out their silhouette."
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 5,
        "ystrength": 20,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_lightningmagic"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just as he makes to run again, a thunderclap strikes next to his feet."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1612_1#16$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hold it!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan"
    },
    {
        "text": "Move another inch, and the next bolt is hitting your head.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan"
    },
    {
        "text": "Answer my questions.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Masked Individual"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1612_1#16$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why set fire to Ding Feng Lou? Is your target Mo Bufu, or someone else?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan"
    },
    {
        "text": "All the previous incidents, they were your doing too, weren't they?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan"
    },
    {
        "text": "Also... the scrollery?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Masked Individual"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1612_1#16$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You... and your accomplices, must have some aim in all these actions\u2014what is it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Masked Individual"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1612_1#16$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not talking? Then I'll take you back to the Judicial Review Office, for a nice long questioning\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Deputy Minister Lin, surely you wouldn't ask if you didn't know the answer already?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Masked Individual"
    },
    {
        "text": "Can you not see the truth, or do you simply pretend you can't because you don't dare to?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Masked Individual"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1612_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Office is a good place, but I don't plan on visiting it for now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Masked Individual"
    },
    {
        "text": "Besides, when your will wavers, the thunder you throw isn't so frightening.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Masked Individual"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's time you opened your eyes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Masked Individual"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1612_1#16$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1612_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_carwash",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "And with that, the masked figure is on the move. Just as Lin Qingyan would give chase, the ceiling sprinklers start up out of nowhere."
    },
    {
        "text": "Ice-cold water pours down, soaking her head to foot."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#10$1",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Leizi\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You alright?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1612_1#16$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dammit.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "25_g11_yanroom",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$ponder_intro",
        "key": "$ponder_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1635_1#1$1",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The customers are all safely out of the way, there's just a few in shock. Thank goodness no one was injured...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Flustered Chef"
    },
    {
        "text": "We've reported it to the authorities. The mandarins should be here any moment...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Flustered Chef"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1619_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't we have a mandarin here already?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mo Bufu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1612_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1635_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Head Chef... you're...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Flustered Chef"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1619_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm fine... I owe it to this girl.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mo Bufu"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's nothing left for you to do here. Go on, go home.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mo Bufu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1635_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Once the chefs leave, Lin Qingyan locks the door to the room."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1612_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mr. Mo, if I could have a word or two with you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1619_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You know this girl, madam?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mo Bufu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "She's a friend of mine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "Chef Mo, she's on the trail of a really important case. Would it be alright if you, uh, tried to answer her questions...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1619_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph... I don't like what the mandarins get up to, but I don't like to spurn a favor either. You saved my life today, and that's more favor than I'll ever repay.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mo Bufu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1619_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Go ahead, then. Ask away.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mo Bufu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1612_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm looking for one of your restaurant's chefs. He's a witness in a case.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan"
    },
    {
        "text": "I believe ten years ago, he was working in the Ministry of Justice death row prison, making last meals for convicts.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "A chef who only makes last meals... How exactly did he pass the Ding Feng Lou exams?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1612_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ding Feng Lou serves all manner of mandarins every year at the Feast of a Hundred Delicacies. That means every chef's background must be clear as day for the record.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan"
    },
    {
        "text": "I imagine he shouldn't be hard to find.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1619_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What exactly do you want me to say, madam?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mo Bufu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1619_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "First my restaurant catches fire for no reason. Now you say we have a chef who made meals for dead men. Should I even bother to open Ding Feng Lou again?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mo Bufu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1612_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I understand your situation, sir. That's why I'm choosing to ask you these things in private.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1619_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Whatever. It's not like I can't admit to my own past.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mo Bufu"
    },
    {
        "text": "The chef you're looking for, the death row caterer Mo Xiaoliu, that was me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mo Bufu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1612_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I thought so...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1619_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And making last meals is nothing shameful. The powerful need to eat, and so do the powerless.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mo Bufu"
    },
    {
        "text": "My cooking skills come from that prison, making last meals for death row convicts from all corners of the country.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mo Bufu"
    },
    {
        "text": "As for changing my name and hiding my identity, I just didn't want to make any trouble for this restaurant.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mo Bufu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm beginning to... sort of admire you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1612_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you remember, ten years ago, a convict admitted to the prison by the name of Gu Quan?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you don't remember the name, you should at least remember that some decades ago, he was the one and only person to be released from death row.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "What?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait! You mean my dad? Why'd my dad get the death penalty?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1612_1#16$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Blaze!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1619_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You mean Gu Quan? He was your father?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mo Bufu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#12$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1612_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "So you remember him...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1619_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I do... all too well.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mo Bufu"
    },
    {
        "text": "I spent so many years in there making last meals. I met countless horrific scoundrels, endless connivers. As each one of them ate before they left, the look in their eyes, it was always more or less the same.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mo Bufu"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I'd never seen someone whose eyes were so clear, so clean, so free of anything.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mo Bufu"
    },
    {
        "text": "He wasn't like the other convicts. In his time, he never wept, never howled, and never screamed injustice, not even on the day he was imprisoned.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mo Bufu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1619_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even I found it strange how a man like him could end up on death row.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mo Bufu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#12$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why would... my dad...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1612_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then do you know, at the time, what charges Gu Quan was sentenced to death on?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1619_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not at the time...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mo Bufu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1612_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not at the time?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1619_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But one year later, when I joined Ding Feng Lou and began taking part in the Feast of a Hundred Delicacies, I came across a menu for a Feast from a few years before\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mo Bufu"
    },
    {
        "text": "That was when I learned that at that Feast, Gu Quan served a dish to the True Lung. It just so happens, that was the same dish this girl pulled down earlier. 'Medley of Whites'.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mo Bufu"
    },
    {
        "text": "But next to that dish, he placed a steamed flour bun, and in it... was a filling of red pickled tofu.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mo Bufu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "So... what does it mean? Why would he get locked up just for serving that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1612_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lin Qingyan, aren't you gonna say anything?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1619_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your relative told you the story of the Grand Preceptor, but never told you her eventual fate?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mo Bufu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#13$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Her... fate?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1612_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1612_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Forty years ago, the Grand Preceptor plotted to assassinate the True Lung. She committed suicide after it failed. Every single one of her underlings was arrested and trialed, and their numbers were over a thousand...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1619_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "When Gu Quan served that dish at the Feast, it signified redressing her for her treason. It made the True Lung furious.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mo Bufu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No way... my dad told me so many times, the Grand Preceptor was loyal to the country, the people, the whole realm! How the hell could she be a traitor?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1612_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The history books have it that way, yes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And they're right?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lin Qingyan, if everything written in them is true, what the hell are you investigating?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1612_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1040_blaze2_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And... and besides, my dad didn't actually get killed, right? Doesn't that prove, like, at least <i>some</i> people from the court believed the Grand Preceptor and my dad were both innocent?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1612_1#13$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's a sticking point, yes. If Gu Quan was imprisoned as part of the Grand Preceptor case, why would they free him afterwards?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1619_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It stuck with me too... You see, after entering prison, Gu Quan had two visitors, and both were people I happened to know...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mo Bufu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1619_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "One was the person delivering his meal. Yu Cheng, deputy minister of the Office at the time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mo Bufu"
    },
    {
        "text": "And the other was the one who brought him out... former Minister of Rites, Ning Shu.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mo Bufu"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1612_1#10$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What...?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "Quick! This way! Surround the place immediately!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice Outside the Door"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_soldiersrun"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1637_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1637_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1612_1#16$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dammit... why now...?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1613_1#7$1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What a coincidence. One step ahead of me, Deputy Minister Lin.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chen Che"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1612_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'd just arrived. A coincidence, indeed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Qingyan"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1613_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Judicial Review Office is investigating the Ding Feng Lou fire. I ask all of you to be cooperative.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chen Che"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lin Qingyan, and the girl next to you, come with me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Chen Che"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
